cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "HRNet-Footprint-Trainer"
abstract: >-
  Training pipeline for building footprint segmentation on high-resolution
  orthophotos. Generates sliding-window patches from large GeoTIFFs and building
  vector labels, trains HRNet-W48 with FCNHead on MMSegmentation, and performs
  sliding-window inference over arbitrarily large images. Includes a NoData-aware
  transform that sets black and white regions to the ignore index so image
  borders do not contribute to the loss.
